createDate\":null,\"content\":\"\",\"replyCount\":0,\"viewCount\":0},{\"feedUrl\":\"https://upgradedpoints.com/feed/\",\"feedTitle\":\"UpgradedPoints.com\",\"feedIcon\":\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=upgradedpoints.com&sz=64\",\"feedCategory\":\"Others\",\"title\":\"New Chase Offer for 10% Cash-Back at U.S. Marriott Hotels [Targeted]\",\"link\":\"https://upgradedpoints.com/news/chase-offers-marriott/\",\"image\":\"https://upgradedpoints.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/02/JW-Marriott-Grand-Rapids-Desk-and-TV-Unit.jpg\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-07-21T18:15:00.000Z\",\"createDate\":null,\"content\":\"Similar to Amex Offers, Chase has its own set of discounts through its Chase Offers portal. In its latest round, Chase is featuring up to 10% back at Marriott hotels, up to a maximum of $50 back . Here’s how you can save with this discount. Save 10% at Marriott Hotels This Chase Offer for 10% off at Marriott hotels is targeted, so you might not see all or any of these in your accounts. The full deal allows you to earn 10% cash-back on your Marriott Bonvoy stay when you spend $100 or more, including taxes and after any discounts, with a $50 cash-back maximum. One important point to note is that this offer is valid only at Marriott Bonvoy properties located in the U.S. So any bookings made for international properties will be ineligible. Save up to $50 total at Marriott properties in the U.S. with this Chase Offer. Screenshot: Chase The offer expires on August 31, 2026 , so you’ll need to complete your booking prior to that date to take advantage of it. Your trip can take place beyond that date, as long as you’ve already prepaid for your stay by the expiration date. To check if you were targeted for any of these Chase Offers, you’ll want to log in at chase.com or on your Chase mobile app ( iOS , Android ) and cycle through each of your Chase cards to see which offers are available. From there, you can tap to add each offer to your card. Not all cardholders or cards will be targeted. Finally, payment must be made directly with Marriott and is not valid when booking through online travel agencies (OTAs). Maximizing the Marriott Chase Offers Keep in mind that you can only spend once per offer. Unlike many Amex Offers, which allow you to spend multiple times to achieve a maximum redemption, Chase Offers are typically valid for just a single purchase. Thus, offers that provide 10% cash-back after spending $100 are best used on your largest purchase, which may mean waiting to use them. If you have a few stays planned, each of a different amount, you may want to consider not using the card with the offer until the most expensive stay. In this way, you can maximize the amount of cash-back you’ll receive. Hot Tip: Learn more about the best current Chase Offers , including travel, dining, entertainment, and shopping. Final Thoughts This Chase Offer represents a great opportunity to save up to $50 on your next Marriott stay within the U.S. If you’re looking at a Marriott stay in the near future, check to see if you’re targeted to save money with Chase Offers.\",\"replyCount\":0,\"viewCount\":0},{\"feedUrl\":\"https://www.theverge.com/rss/index.xml\",\"feedTitle\":\"The Verge\",\"feedIcon\":\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=www.theverge.com&sz=64\",\"feedCategory\":\"Tech\",\"title\":\"Peak Design’s modular Field Bracket has a finder tag built-in\",\"link\":\"https://www.theverge.com/gadgets/968771/peak-design-camera-field-bracket-kickstarter\",\"image\":\"https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/07/Peak-Design-Field-Bracket.jpg?quality=90&#038;strip=all&#038;crop=0,0,100,100\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-07-21T18:12:02.000Z\",\"createDate\":null,\"content\":\"I am a very clumsy man. So clumsy, that I have AirTags hanging off practically every camera I own. Have I left my camera in an Uber? Yes. Have I left it on an airplane? Also yes. For me, finder tags are essential for my cameras. The problem is, strapping a finder tag to a camera is always cumbersome. I currently have them hanging off my camera straps like a phone charm circa 2001. They're ugly, and very much get in the way when I'm trying to focus on shooting. But Peak Design thinks it has a solution in its new Field Bracket system, which it launched today on Kickstarter, starting at $150 for early birds . The Peak Design Field Bracket is p … Read the full story at The Verge.\",\"replyCount\":0,\"viewCount\":0},{\"feedUrl\":\"https://news.ycombinator.com/rss\",\"feedTitle\":\"Hacker News\",\"feedIcon\":\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=news.ycombinator.com&sz=64\",\"feedCategory\":\"Tech\",\"title\":\"How did the H1B visa become the 'Indian' visa\",\"link\":\"https://numberstation.fm/the-body-shop/\",\"image\":\"/api/og-image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnumberstation.fm%2Fthe-body-shop%2F&rss=&icon=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.google.com%2Fs2%2Ffavicons%3Fdomain%3Dnews.ycombinator.com%26sz%3D64\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-07-21T18:10:04.000Z\",\"createDate\":null,\"content\":\"Comments\",\"replyCount\":0,\"viewCount\":0},{\"feedUrl\":\"https://feeds.content.dowjones.io/public/rss/RSSWorldNews\",\"feedTitle\":\"WSJ.com: World News\",\"feedIcon\":\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=wsj.com&sz=64\",\"feedCategory\":\"Business\",\"title\":\"Ukraine’s Battle-Tested Drone Boats to Be Made in U.S. for the First Time\",\"link\":\"https://www.wsj.com/politics/national-security/ukraines-battle-tested-drone-boats-to-be-made-in-the-u-s-for-the-first-time-2aae98b2\",\"image\":\"https://images.wsj.net/im-83996148\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-07-21T18:09:00.000Z\",\"createDate\":null,\"content\":\"Efrem Lukatsky/Associated Press\",\"replyCount\":0,\"viewCount\":0},{\"feedUrl\":\"https://news.ycombinator.com/rss\",\"feedTitle\":\"Hacker News\",\"feedIcon\":\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=news.ycombinator.com&sz=64\",\"feedCategory\":\"Tech\",\"title\":\"YouTube System Design for Robotics Data Infrastructure\",\"link\":\"https://hebbianrobotics.com/b