udes insider tips, real-world travel experiences, and points-and-miles strategies from the experts at Upgraded Points. Are Hotel and Airline Status Worth It? Have you ever asked yourself whether it’s worth it to earn elite status with a hotel or airline ? Chances are, you have, and so have we. Today, we’re discussing the value of elite status , and we’ve even polled some Upgraded Points team members to get their take. Additionally, hosts Katie Corrigan Seemann and Chris Hassan discuss a big millennial stereotype Chris just broke (it was worth it, though), Katie’s recent Amex Hotel Collection experience (including another awkward bathroom layout), and an update we received from one of the grand prize winners of our 1-Year Podcast Anniversary giveaway, who redeemed a Hilton Be My Guest certificate for huge value . Listen to or watch this week’s episode on Apple Podcasts: Links to the Podcast: RSS Feed YouTube Apple Spotify Hot Tip: Do you have a question or comment for the show? Email us at podcast@upgradedpoints.com .\",\"replyCount\":0,\"viewCount\":0},{\"feedUrl\":\"https://search.cnbc.com/rs/search/combinedcms/view.xml?partnerId=wrss01&id=10001147\",\"feedTitle\":\"Business News\",\"feedIcon\":\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=cnbc.com&sz=64\",\"feedCategory\":\"Business\",\"title\":\"GM announces new gas-powered Cadillac vehicles amid EV pullback\",\"link\":\"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/07/21/gm-new-gas-powered-cadillac.html\",\"image\":\"/api/og-image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.cnbc.com%2F2026%2F07%2F21%2Fgm-new-gas-powered-cadillac.html&rss=&icon=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.google.com%2Fs2%2Ffavicons%3Fdomain%3Dcnbc.com%26sz%3D64\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-07-21T13:54:41.000Z\",\"createDate\":null,\"content\":\"GM CEO Mary Barra said Tuesday the next-generation Cadillacs will include new versions of the CT5 sedan, XT5 midsize SUV and discontinued three-row XT6 SUV.\",\"replyCount\":0,\"viewCount\":0},{\"feedUrl\":\"https://seekingalpha.com/tag/etf-portfolio-strategy.xml\",\